# Published walkthroughs.
#
# Every walkthrough is served by one static HTML file that reads its slug from
# the path at runtime — scenes are published long after the site is built, so
# there is nothing to prerender. This rewrite is what makes /view/casa-altinho/
# work instead of only /view/?s=casa-altinho.
#
# 200, not 301: the browser must keep the original URL so the page can read the
# slug out of it. A redirect would rewrite the address bar and lose it.
/view/*  /view/index.html  200
